like I would say,

00:45:01.198 --> 00:45:02.833
the maximum amount of democracy

00:45:02.833 --> 00:45:04.501 align:start size:81% position:19%
needs to be as
local as possible,

00:45:04.501 --> 00:45:05.769
as local as possible,

00:45:05.769 --> 00:45:08.172
as little centralized
authority as possible.

00:45:09.640 --> 00:45:11.575
But there obviously needs to
be a degree of organization.

00:45:11.575 --> 00:45:14.445
I would say, well, if the price

00:45:14.445 --> 00:45:16.180 align:start size:84% position:16%
