being left alone

00:45:16.180 --> 00:45:17.881 align:start size:97% position:3%
is the people of California
being left alone,

00:45:17.881 --> 00:45:22.152 align:start position:0%
if you want to use those
geographical, preexisting states

00:45:22.152 --> 00:45:23.654
and that kind of terminology-

00:45:23.654 --> 00:45:25.189
- I'm just trying to bring us
down to something on earth.

00:45:25.189 --> 00:45:27.391
I got what you're doing at
the meta physical level.

00:45:27.391 --> 00:45:28.625
Yeah, yeah.

00:45:28.625 --> 00:45:30.294
- As much democracy as possible.

00:45:30.294 --> 00:45:32.396
As much democracy as
possible, I suppose.

00:45:32.396 --> 00:45:33.630
And again, this sort of

00:45:33.630 --> 00:45:35.966
is not going to be
immediately perfect,

00:45:35.966 --> 00:45:39.770 align:start size:97% position:3%
