00:45:51.281 --> 00:45:56.019 align:start size:97% position:3%
So some form of radical
reorganization is required.

00:45:56.754 --> 00:45:58.222
And I would say that

00:45:58.222 --> 00:45:59.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
to focus primarily on
where is power coalescing?

00:45:59.957 --> 00:46:01.091
Is it observable?

00:46:01.091 --> 00:46:02.826
Are there giant corporations

00:46:02.826 --> 00:46:04.394
