00:47:45.329 --> 00:47:46.597
I'm personally in recovery.

00:47:46.597 --> 00:47:49.166
That's what I am really,
is a person in recovery.

00:47:49.166 --> 00:47:53.103 align:start size:97% position:3%
So I'm aware of my
frailties, I'm aware of that.

00:47:53.103 --> 00:47:55.405
And in a way, isn't it that...

00:47:55.405 --> 00:47:59.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
