00:51:43.467 --> 00:51:44.968 align:start size:97% position:3%
- Well, sometimes I do feel
a bit guilty, actually.

00:51:44.968 --> 00:51:46.203
- Do you?

00:51:46.203 --> 00:51:47.704
- A little bit.

00:51:47.704 --> 00:51:49.573
I mean, I wish that everybody
lived really, really well,

00:51:49.573 --> 00:51:52.909
but as I say, I come from
a pretty normal background

00:51:52.909 --> 00:51:55.278
and for a while I
was a drug addict

00:51:55.278 --> 00:51:57.547
and I've lived on welfare

00:51:57.547 --> 00:52:00.250
