call it in England.

00:52:03.887 --> 00:52:05.655
And so I do a bit think,
"oh God, is this right?"

00:52:05.655 --> 00:52:08.158
But then 'cause also it's
for me, the grandiosity,

00:52:08.158 --> 00:52:09.359
"but I earned this on merit."

00:52:09.359 --> 00:52:10.760
I do recognize

00:52:10.760 --> 00:52:13.797 align:start size:97% position:3%
that there are certain
revenue generating skill sets

00:52:13.797 --> 00:52:15.999
