that's grown where you are

00:59:51.854 --> 00:59:55.124
and people should support
local farming enterprises."

00:59:55.124 --> 00:59:56.559
And Vandana Shiva who,

00:59:56.559 --> 01:00:00.196 align:start position:0%
"do not let industrialized
agriculture take over the wall."

01:00:00.196 --> 01:00:04.500 align:start size:88% position:13%
Like these voices
ought to be integrated,

01:00:04.500 --> 01:00:06.369
incorporated, amplified.

01:00:06.369 --> 01:00:08.171 align:start size:81% position:19%
And these terms
of left and right,

01:00:08.171 --> 01:00:10.206 align:start size:84% position:16%
I reckon we've gotta
let go of them.

01:00:10.206 --> 01:00:12.942
I mean, I know that's sort
of part of your narrative,

01:00:12.942 --> 01:00:14.477
your story, your life.

01:00:14.477 --> 01:00:17.046
