like a Marxist communist,

01:00:29.892 --> 01:00:31.995
now I'm a right-wing
conspiracy theorist,

01:00:31.995 --> 01:00:33.563
I'm saying the same thing.

01:00:33.563 --> 01:00:34.764
- It's kind of fun

01:00:34.764 --> 01:00:35.865 align:start size:88% position:13%
to keep people on their
toes though, right?

01:00:35.865 --> 01:00:37.767
Like in its own way,

01:00:37.767 --> 01:00:39.669 align:start position:0%
even though I don't think you're
doing it by design, right?

01:00:39.669 --> 01:00:41.738
- Next time I'll come
back as a vampire.

01:00:42.939 --> 01:00:44.407
I'm a vampire now.

01:00:44.407 --> 01:00:45.675
I'm Pinocchio.

01:00:45.675 --> 01:00:47.176
