01:01:00.423 --> 01:01:01.858
- No, like I live...

01:01:01.858 --> 01:01:05.628 align:start position:0%
Like look, the focus of my
life is my wife and my children

01:01:05.628 --> 01:01:10.033 align:start position:0%
and my meditation and my
recovery and Brazilian jiu-jitsu

01:01:11.000 --> 01:01:14.604
and just trying to hold together

01:01:14.604 --> 01:01:17.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
